# Node.js / npm
node_modules/

# Ignore all dist directories — with exceptions below for committed artefacts
dist/
packages/*/dist/
!packages/tokens/dist/
packages/tokens/dist/*
!packages/tokens/dist/token-catalogue.json
# The 2026-09-01 pre-publish audit briefly un-ignored the package build trees,
# believing npm pack would otherwise ship config files with no code. Tested in M2
# and that is not so: both packages pack byte-identically either way, because
# `@spec-kitty/styles` is governed by its package.json `files` allowlist. The
# exceptions bought nothing and let a stray `git add -A` commit compiled output,
# so they were removed. `packages/tokens/dist/token-catalogue.json` above is the
# one deliberate exception: it is a published artifact consumers fetch directly.

.nx/cache
.nx/workspace-data

# npm
npm-debug.log*

.sass-cache/
*.css.map
*.sass.map
*.scss.map

